\newlabel{fig:alice}{{3}{6}{Alice: independent contextual extraction (B) for two requests over identical complete evidence. Display: two of five action edges (two sitting edges and Rabbit running omitted) and two of three claims (book content omitted). All remain scored. Executed action question: \AliceActionQuestion \ Executed claims question: \AliceClaimQuestion \ Source excerpts are marked. + indicates supported meaning, x an unsupported participant, and ? unresolved consideration. The thought remains the actual sentence-valued object. All bounds are null. The final record has holder Alice and null attitude.\relax }{figure.caption.3}{}}
